                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm going to keep it short: this visual novel actually has an interesting concept... but the English translation is [i]so bad[/i] that it ruined the whole game for me. I'm not talking about small grammar mistakes, I'm talking about whole scenes that don't make sense at all because you can't understand what's happening and what the characters are saying. Some scenes are alright, but most of them are incomprehensible. It's obvious that several people with different levels of knowledge in English translated the script.\n\nI've also noticed a weird bug that appeared during my playthroughs, making it impossible to keep playing the VN since I couldn't use the prophet power and I got killed every time in a particular scene without any options to react. That happened a few times and I was able to finish the routes once I started a new game more than once.\n\n3/10.",
